The synthetic audio data, manifest and reference annotations in this directory
are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

These fixtures are generated from mathematical sine waves without external
recordings, voices, research corpora or samples. This dedication applies to this
example dataset only; it does not select or change the AudioLab source license.
